Package: kapitan-sh
Version: 0.1.0~alpha1
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Umut Korkmaz <umutkorkmaz.32@gmail.com>
Installed-Size: 54
Depends: bash (>= 4.0), jq
Section: shells
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/UmutKorkmaz/KAPiTaN-OS
Description: KAPiTaN OS Turkish command layer
 kapitan-sh provides a Turkish-language command interface for KAPiTaN OS,
 mapping Turkish verb aliases to standard POSIX/Linux commands. It is a
 pure Bash login-shell wrapper with a JSON-driven command registry.
